2aebb31a","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-e96ffada202f222baadb","layer":"original","quote":"杨将眭固杀丑，将其众，欲北合袁绍。太祖遣史涣邀击，破之于犬城，斩固，尽收其众也","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":51},{"id":"wudi-e-o061b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":49},{"id":"wudi-e-o062a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01656b554fda06a0ac10","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，进军临河，使史涣、曹仁渡河击之〖5〗。固使杨故长史薛洪、河内太守缪尚留守〖6〗，自将兵北迎绍求救。与涣、仁相遇犬城〖7〗，交战；大破之，斩固。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
